  dialogueList:
  - He is the Soulward of Ritus. His rage knows no end or respite.
  - Soon, his knights will sweep the world in vengeant flames. Nought left to grieve
    but ashes.
  - For this land to live on, in fealty to the Sacrament and my companions, I must
    stand with steel awaiting that day.
